---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const updated = '2026-05-06';
---
<Base title="Now" description="What I'm focused on right now.">
  <article class="prose">
    <p class="kicker mono">now · updated {updated}</p>
    <h1>What I'm doing now.</h1>
    <p>
      Working on iOS at my day job. Quiet phase — refactoring, not shipping new surfaces.
    </p>
    <p>
      On the side, building tiny tools with Claude and friends. Mostly to see what the loops <em>feel</em> like.
      Half of them die in the file system. That's fine.
    </p>
    <p>
      Reading <a class="link" href="/bookshelf">a few books</a> in parallel, which is a habit I keep
      pretending I'll quit.
    </p>
    <p class="muted small">
      A "now page" is a <a class="link" href="https://nownownow.com/about" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Derek-Sivers idea</a>:
      a single page that answers "what are you up to lately?" so you don't have to email people about it.
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .prose { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.1rem; }
  .kicker { font-size: 0.78rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: var(--fg-faint); }
  .prose h1 { max-width: 22ch; margin-bottom: 0.3rem; }
  .prose p { font-size: 1.03rem; line-height: 1.6; }
  .small { font-size: 0.88rem; }
</style>
